{"date":"2026-10-12","level":"n4","title":"祖母との梅干し作り","text":"先日、祖母の家に行って、一緒に梅干し作りをした。梅を洗ったり、塩をまぶしたりして、瓶に入れた。祖母は毎年この時期に作るので、手順をよく知っていた。わたしは初めてだったので失敗するかもしれないと思ったが、ていねいに教えてもらいながら、無事に作ることができた。できあがるまでには一か月ほどかかるそうだ。","tokens":[{"surface_form":"先日","basic_form":"先日","reading":"せんじつ","pos":"名詞"},{"surface_form":"、","basic_form":"、","reading":"、","pos":"記号"},{"surface_form":"祖母","basic_form":"祖母","reading":"そぼ","pos":"名詞"},{"surface_form":"の","basic_form":"の","reading":"の","pos":"助詞"},{"surface_form":"家","basic_form":"家","reading":"いえ","pos":"名詞"},{"surface_form":"に","basic_form":"に","reading":"に","pos":"助詞"},{"surface_form":"行って","basic_form":"行く","reading":"いって","pos":"動詞"},{"surface_form":"、","basic_form":"、","reading":"、","pos":"記号"},{"surface_form":"一緒に","basic_form":"一緒に","reading":"いっしょに","pos":"副詞"},{"surface_form":"梅干し","basic_form":"梅干し","reading":"うめぼし","pos":"名詞"},{"surface_form":"作り","basic_form":"作り","reading":"づくり","pos":"名詞"},{"surface_form":"を","basic_form":"を","reading":"を","pos":"助詞"},{"surface_form":"した","basic_form":"する","reading":"した","pos":"動詞"},{"surface_form":"。","basic_form":"。","reading":"。","pos":"記号"},{"surface_form":"梅","basic_form":"梅","reading":"うめ","pos":"名詞"},{"surface_form":"を","basic_form":"を","reading":"を","pos":"助詞"},{"surface_form":"洗ったり","basic_form":"洗う","reading":"あらったり","pos":"動詞"},{"surface_form":"、","basic_form":"、","reading":"、","pos":"記号"},{"surface_form":"塩","basic_form":"塩","reading":"しお","pos":"名詞"},{"surface_form":"を","basic_form":"を","reading":"を","pos":"助詞"},{"surface_form":"まぶしたり","basic_form":"まぶす","reading":"まぶしたり","pos":"動詞"},{"surface_form":"して","basic_form":"する","reading":"して","pos":"動詞"},{"surface_form":"、","basic_form":"、","reading":"、","pos":"記号"},{"surface_form":"瓶","basic_form":"瓶","reading":"びん","pos":"名詞"},{"surface_form":"に","basic_form":"に","reading":"に","pos":"助詞"},{"surface_form":"入れた","basic_form":"入れる","reading":"いれた","pos":"動詞"},{"surface_form":"。","basic_form":"。","reading":"。","pos":"記号"},{"surface_